# ── Build context size ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Neither Dockerfile copies these, but everything not ignored is still packed up
# and shipped to the daemon before the first instruction runs. tests/ alone is
# ~14 GB of fixtures and corpora, so excluding it is the difference between a
# build that starts immediately and one that spends minutes transferring data it
# will never open.
#
# docs/ and snippets/ are deliberately NOT here: both images COPY them for the
# embedded runtime help.
tests/
artifacts/
